# Monitor Component

Ethereum monitoring service that tracks 0xSplits contracts, validators, and Safe transactions with configurable notifications.

## Key Integration Pattern
Event-driven architecture with pluggable notification sources (Discord, Telegram, Email) and monitoring services (Split, Validator, Safe).

## Important Constraints
- All services must expose Prometheus metrics for observability
- Event notifications should be rate-limited to prevent spam
- Maintain connection pooling for Ethereum nodes to handle high-throughput monitoring